(body-axis-aero)
*title Body-axis aerodynamic coefficient set
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=600 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=20
  *file body-axis.dat time mach cx cy cz accebx acceby accebz
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *aero cx=(test-cx) cy=(test-cy) cz=(test-cz)
    *fly yawgd=90
    *fly pitchgd=0
    *fly rollgd=0
    *when time=2 stop
*end
